graph TD
    subgraph "EXTRACT Phase"
        TS[🚦 Traffic Sensors<br/>Filter]
        WS[🌡️ Weather Stations<br/>Filter]
        AQ[🌫️ Air Quality Monitors<br/>Filter]
        TC[📹 Traffic Cameras<br/>Filter]
    end
    
    subgraph "TRANSFORM Phase"
        DC[🔧 Data Cleansing<br/>Filter]
        DV[✅ Data Validation<br/>Filter]
        DN[📊 Data Normalization<br/>Filter]
        DE[🔗 Data Enrichment<br/>Filter]
        DF[📏 Data Formatting<br/>Filter]
    end
    
    subgraph "LOAD Phase"
        RT[⚡ Real-time Analytics DB<br/>Filter]
        DW[🏢 Data Warehouse<br/>Filter]
        HA[📈 Historical Analysis DB<br/>Filter]
    end
    
    subgraph "External Data Sources"
        GTA[🏛️ Government Traffic APIs<br/>Filter]
        WD[🌍 Weather Data APIs<br/>Filter]
    end
    
    %% Extract to Transform pipes
    TS -->|Raw Traffic Data<br/>Pipe| DC
    WS -->|Raw Weather Data<br/>Pipe| DC
    AQ -->|Raw Air Quality Data<br/>Pipe| DC
    TC -->|Raw Camera Data<br/>Pipe| DC
    
    %% Transform pipeline
    DC -->|Cleaned Data<br/>Pipe| DV
    DV -->|Validated Data<br/>Pipe| DN
    DN -->|Normalized Data<br/>Pipe| DE
    
    %% External enrichment
    GTA -.->|Traffic Reports<br/>Pipe| DE
    WD -.->|Weather Context<br/>Pipe| DE
    
    DE -->|Enriched Data<br/>Pipe| DF
    
    %% Load phase
    DF -->|Analytics Ready Data<br/>Pipe| RT
    DF -->|Structured Data<br/>Pipe| DW
    DF -->|Historical Data<br/>Pipe| HA